          "text": "Ariko mweho mur’ ubgoko bgātoranijwe, mukoranije kuba abami n’abaherezi, mur’ ihanga ryera, abantu bāshiriweho kuba inyegu yiharije, kugira ngo mukwize ishimwe ry’Iyabahamagaye, ikabakūra mu mwiza, ikabashitsa mu muco wayo utangaje: ",
